{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在TVB節目《愛‧回家之三代同糖》中，李偉健（Terry）飾演做生意永遠「執輸行頭」的嘉驄，劇中他大晒隱藏畫功，即時勾起網民的集體回憶！Terry更在戲外親手畫畫贈「孫女」Desta（李茵彤飾），畫作卻被對方搞笑投訴？網民除了激讚其畫功，更紛紛召喚《愛‧回家之開心速遞》的KC，希望Terry為好拍檔作畫！</p><p>Terry劇中重拾畫筆 網民驚艷：回憶返晒嚟</p><p>前晚一集劇情講述，做生意屢戰屢敗的嘉驄（李偉健飾）因投資杜拜朱古力再次損手爛腳。為了救亡，外甥女唐芯（李茵彤飾）逆向思維，以「超難食」作招徠，瞄準消費者的「獵奇」心態促銷。促銷當日，嘉驄更即席為顧客（梁倩萱飾）繪畫速成肖像畫，並將作品在IG曝光，畫功令人驚喜！此幕一出，不少網民即時大嘆「回憶返晒嚟」，並再次為Terry的畫功感到驚艷：「啲畫好靚，畫多啲吖！」、「Terry 畫畫好靚。」</p><p>戲外畫孫女Desta被投訴？神還原大板牙勁爆笑</p><p>為了回饋粉絲，Terry在個人社交網站上載了一幅獨家畫作，內容是第一集中孫女Desta勇敢制服「咸豬手」唐嘉麟的場面。畫作最得意之處，是同時有齊「素顏版」及「濃妝版」的Desta，更刻意將Desta的大板牙巨大化，非常搞笑。Desta本尊也留言投訴：「舅公，我喺你心目中隻牙係特別大嘅？！」雖然畫作帶點誇張，但無損Terry捕捉到Desta的神緒，網民都大讚畫得維肖維妙。</p><p>Terry密密畫場口漫畫 預告將陸續曝光</p><p>李偉健的畫功早已深入民心，據知，他這次亦悄悄地為新劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》畫了不少「場口漫畫」。這些作品記錄了劇中多個有趣場面，充滿個人風格。相關作品更會陸陸續續在他的個人社交網站上曝光，相信會為劇迷帶來一浪接一浪的驚喜，粉絲們記得密切期待，隨時捕獲Terry的最新大作！</p><p>網民召喚《開心速遞》KC 求Terry畫好拍檔</p><p>Terry的畫功再次引起網民熱議，除了大讚他多才多藝，更將焦點轉移到他在《愛‧回家之開心速遞》的好拍檔歐瑞偉（KC）身上。不少忠實觀眾紛紛留言，直接向Terry「下單」，召喚KC登場：「可唔可以畫張你同 KC 架？」看來大家對這對經典CP的愛，已跨越到新劇集。更有網民表示：「跪求Terry畫KC！送水輝同大小姐都要！」、「好期待佢之後啲漫畫，一定會追住睇！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01a_17866368216a87debb6fdbc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_2230897886a87debf748ee.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_728159256a87ded139a36.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_12276908956a87dee391645.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_5616537746a87def8db987.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_6095267626a87df065041e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_21214707526a87df21072dd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_7136958016a87df2c814fa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_18238282186a87df3313d78.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_9113061726a87e070a18bb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_4949501096a87e07434fc0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_13441325346a87e085d807d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_6482607556a87e093169e9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_5806432336a87e0a1a0207.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_1226445226a87e0aedd018.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_9463185566a87e0b279f2d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16a_15526035846a87e0b615d04.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_20163018536a87e0b9952e0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_15656907226a87e0bddcfe6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_18857525376a87e0ca06358.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_8005172926a87e0df7990d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_11362166406a87e0f284ec3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_238115336a87e10264a55.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_15883415486a87e1145f792.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_12523438406a87e1212a98f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_21048887136a87e13c6b7d8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_2925907756a87e13fd7f2d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_17610228436a87e14360862.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27_15839014606a87e153f1ab4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28_9142716476a87e1666e850.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/29_20273837796a87e173ba342.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/30_3071496246a87e185e0881.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/31_7678454206a87e1935ab3a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/32_4663250136a87e1a2dbba3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/33_8272384706a87e1b4e88e5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/34_5908318616a87e1b9bcdfb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/35_12085103196a87e1bf9150d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/36_20855243796a87e1c499949.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/37_17746602026a87e1db0d3d9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/38_1296429276a87e26796148.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/39_19026188626a87e2b0e3abb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/40_8735046666a87e3056efaf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/41_16296811576a87e313153f4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/42_19873467156a87e3256de52.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/43_18358970866a87e33b759be.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : tvb即時資訊 愛回家之三代同糖 李偉健 開心速遞</p><p>圖片來源：TVB 資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Aug 21 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T06:51:30.537350+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1366,"images":45,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}